  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Use Azure Database Migration Service to migrate MySQL databases hosted on-premises, on a virtual machine, or on AWS RDS MySQL, to Azure Database for MySQL while the source database remains online during migration.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/dms/tutorial-mysql-azure-mysql-online\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more</a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Use Azure Database Migration Service to migrate MySQL databases hosted on-premises, on a virtual machine, or on AWS RDS MySQL, to Azure Database for MySQL while the source database remains online during migration.\n\nLearn more"
  },
